1
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,840
Can we make some sandwiches, Dad?

2
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,540
Of course you can. No problem.

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,833
Would you like some help?

4
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,260
No, we're okay, thanks.

5
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,046
Can we use this cheese, Dad?

6
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:27,420
No, your mum wants that for the lasagna. Use this cheese.

7
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:28,260
Okay.

8
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:32,660
We need some salad in the sandwiches. Have we got any?

9
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,980
There's no cucumber, but there are some tomatoes.

10
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:41,120
Let's have cheese and tomato sandwiches then.

11
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,284
Cool.

12
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,080
What are you doing, Dad?

13
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:49,080
I'm putting some peanut butter on the bread. It's tastier than butter.

14
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,320
Don't do that.

15
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:51,400
Too late.

16
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:55,360
The thing is, Sally is allergic to nuts.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,080
Oh no. I'm sorry.

18
00:00:58,723 --> 00:01:00,740
Never mind. I can eat these.

19
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:03,054
And you can make some more.

20
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,940
We can't make any more. We haven't got any more bread.

21
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:10,740
I know. Can we go for fish and chips, Dad?

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:13,820
Hmm, okay. Yes, we can.

23
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:14,820
Great.

24
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,880
And can Sally and Max come too?

25
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,920
Yes, of course they can.

26
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,280
But first, we must clean up this mess.

27
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:28,600
Oh, Dad. We're hungry now. Can we do that later?

28
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,760
No, we can't.

